# Tech Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router (verify against package.json before planning)
- React 19
- Tailwind CSS 4
- Framer Motion (lightweight use only)
- TypeScript strict mode
- Vercel deployment
- No backend database for digital card features
- All card features must work client-side only

- Shipping website changes must use the real Next.js architecture; standalone HTML only for disposable experiments.
- Branch and integrated browser acceptance protocol: docs/development/BRANCHING_INTEGRATION_RELEASE.md
